{"version":1,"content":"<p>早上10時54分，警方接獲西貢蠔涌一名男子報案指，一部有挖斗的小型搬運車翻側，壓著腳部。</p><p>消防到場救出事主，事主兩腳擦傷，清醒送往將軍澳醫院，警方將事件列為工業意外。</p><p>據了解，事主修理該部有挖斗的小型搬運車後，在試車期間翻側。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:46:21.457306+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:26:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:38:54.952721+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T06:39:42.384544+00:00","content_hash":"a97e05055a79608c7b9cf141c7bab48e6f2343fb8d7186d7cf2ff83085b8a08b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}